The built plugin (dist/plugin.js) bundles buzz-app modules unchanged at the
revision in scripts/build-plugin.mjs (BUZZ_APP_REV): among them
src/bundled/goose/runtime.ts, src/bundled/goose/run.ts,
src/bundled/goose/sessions.ts,
src/features/agent-harness/acp/ and src/buzz-mcp/. The build replaces three
modules with this repository's own (see the SWAPS list there).

With them, it bundles the npm packages those modules import, at the versions of
buzz-app's lockfile. Among them are react-markdown 10.1.0 and remark-gfm 4.0.1
(MIT License), which draw the Activity transcript, with the unified, micromark
and mdast libraries they use (MIT License; @ungap/structured-clone: ISC). They
keep their own copyright and license notices in their packages. This repository
lists no dependency of its own.

These files repeat or adapt buzz-app code; each marks it in a comment:

- src/hermes.ts: the process adapter shape of src/bundled/goose/goose.ts,
  its steering hook included.
- src/sessions.ts: wraps src/bundled/goose/sessions.ts, and adapts its
  SharedProcess.
- src/index.ts: the agent type and sessions list of
  src/bundled/goose/index.ts.
- src/views.tsx: the New agent and Settings views of
  src/bundled/goose/tabs.tsx, built from the same buzz-app components.
- src/activity.tsx: the Activity tab of src/bundled/goose/tabs.tsx, built from
  the same buzz-app components.
- src/provider.tsx: the provider dialog and default control of
  src/bundled/goose/tabs.tsx, built from the same buzz-app components.
- src/recorder.ts, src/history.ts: shared with this project's other ACP plugin;
  they write the shape that src/features/agents/activity-transcript.ts reads.
- src/session-read.ts: reading sessions from the harness, their limits and the
  first-prompt check follow src/bundled/goose/transcript.ts; shared with this
  project's other ACP plugin.
- src/transcript.ts: turns from a replay follow src/bundled/goose/transcript.ts;
  shared with this project's other ACP plugin.
- tsconfig.json: the compiler options of buzz-app's tsconfig.json.

